    "essence": "Confidential support, one conversation away",
    "promise": "Serenica is a listening service for the hours that will not lift on their own — soft, unhurried, and built so that nothing you say is kept after you close the tab.",
    "family": "One rosette: a ring, a disc, eight petals cut out of it.",
    "track": "constructed",
    "oneSentence": "Serenica is a support identity printed like a field journal: uncoated stock, six flat inks for six ridges, a petal rosette cut from a single disc, and one marigold accent that only ever appears on the action.",
